{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-content-header-totw.png?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throes of the Watchmaker sends Solstice Warriors Valere and Zale on a side-adventure into the miniature, clockwork world of Horloge, where a cursed carnival threatens its innocent denizens. To survive, they'll need to play by unfamiliar rules and confront not only the mischievous Puppeteer and her minions, but also their own darker traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-3-new-all-b.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey into a magical miniature clockwork world where a plethora of oddities and wonders await. The world of Horloge is filled with over 8 hours of completely new content, including unique environments, NPCs, enemies and dungeons. <br><br>And of course, Sabotage\u2019s composer Eric W. Brown and guest composer Yasunori Mitsuda return to bring a completely fresh set of tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-1-new-classes.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Horloge plays by different rules, and for their magic to manifest, the Solstice Warriors will need to adapt. Zale will tap into his agility to become a Juggler, while Valere will harness her balance to dazzle as an Acrobat. Playing to the circus-themed curse, they will unlock a completely new set of attacks, damage types, skills and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-2-new-character.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artificer joins the party! The friendly engineer robot will finally unlock the laser-shooting capabilities of his construct, and join Valere and Zale in the fight to save Horloge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-4-coop-b.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Couch co-op is available for Throes of the Watchmaker. It allows up to three players to engage in traversal and combat with a \u201cCo-op timed hits\u201d mechanic! <i>Disclaimer: this mode is also available for the entirety of Sea of Stars\u2019 main adventure.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457510?t=1746810417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457510?t=1746810417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/220a36678bf96bfbc27d693f9f4ad75333633b94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746810417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/220a36678bf96bfbc27d693f9f4ad75333633b94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746810417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-content-header-totw.png?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throes of the Watchmaker sends Solstice Warriors Valere and Zale on a side-adventure into the miniature, clockwork world of Horloge, where a cursed carnival threatens its innocent denizens. To survive, they'll need to play by unfamiliar rules and confront not only the mischievous Puppeteer and her minions, but also their own darker traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-3-new-all-b.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey into a magical miniature clockwork world where a plethora of oddities and wonders await. The world of Horloge is filled with over 8 hours of completely new content, including unique environments, NPCs, enemies and dungeons. <br><br>And of course, Sabotage\u2019s composer Eric W. Brown and guest composer Yasunori Mitsuda return to bring a completely fresh set of tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-1-new-classes.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Horloge plays by different rules, and for their magic to manifest, the Solstice Warriors will need to adapt. Zale will tap into his agility to become a Juggler, while Valere will harness her balance to dazzle as an Acrobat. Playing to the circus-themed curse, they will unlock a completely new set of attacks, damage types, skills and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-2-new-character.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artificer joins the party! The friendly engineer robot will finally unlock the laser-shooting capabilities of his construct, and join Valere and Zale in the fight to save Horloge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/extras/steam-totw-header-4-coop-b.gif?t=1746810417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Couch co-op is available for Throes of the Watchmaker. It allows up to three players to engage in traversal and combat with a \u201cCo-op timed hits\u201d mechanic! <i>Disclaimer: this mode is also available for the entirety of Sea of Stars\u2019 main adventure.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sabotage Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1244090","name":"Sea of Stars"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457510/f84c05a690ca5f8883490ee50462e01470a220c6/header.jpg?t=1746810417","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Sabotage Studio 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132990,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132990/movie480.mp4?t=1746215452","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571329